# superglue-js JS/TS conventions

## Native module

- Import from built `index.node` / package exports — document rebuild in README when "Cannot find module".
- Debug builds: `npm run build:native:debug` for faster iteration.

## Tool schemas

```javascript
// Every tool needs explicit parameters schema — no implicit inference
tools.register({
  name: "my_tool",
  parameters: { type: "object", properties: { ... }, required: [...] },
  execute: (args) => { ... },
});
```

## Facade

- Prefer `require("superglue-js/facade")` when normalizing guardrail/hook return shapes.

## TypeScript

- Run `npm run build:ts` after changing public `.d.ts` surface.
- Keep `index.d.ts` aligned with [`superglue-kt`](../../../superglue-kt) JNI expectations.
